Look at the help file for calc_genoprob_fst

   library(qtl2fst)
   ?calc_genoprob_fst

fbase is the base of filename for the fst database. If you use fbase="mycross" the function will write to files like "mycross_1.fst", "mycross_2.fst", etc. It further creates a file "mycross_fstindex.rds".

karl

